WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.240
Episode 43

01:38.260 --> 01:40.050
Now I see.

01:40.500 --> 01:41.880
As a consort,

01:41.900 --> 01:44.310
she shouldn't die in obscurity.

01:44.330 --> 01:46.240
The truth is hidden by someone.

01:46.260 --> 01:48.490
Since it's a top secret,

01:48.730 --> 01:51.630
petty officials like us are not supposed to know it.

01:51.650 --> 01:53.200
You're right.

01:55.940 --> 01:57.180
So I've got

01:57.180 --> 01:58.920
a goal for my life.

01:59.410 --> 02:01.280
I know what I want to do.

02:07.930 --> 02:10.250
I want to be the Head of the Investigator's Office

02:10.290 --> 02:12.560
and become the most powerful minister in Nanqing.

02:14.850 --> 02:16.370
Only in this way

02:16.490 --> 02:18.480
can I be qualified enough to find out the truth.

02:20.340 --> 02:21.970
To find out the truth,

02:22.290 --> 02:25.640
I need assistants and friends.

02:30.370 --> 02:33.530
Your Excellency, I'm here.

02:33.930 --> 02:35.280
You alone won't be enough.

02:37.820 --> 02:39.200
Yan Bingyun?

02:39.260 --> 02:41.760
Your Excellency, you want to take him under your wing.

02:41.780 --> 02:43.900
But it won't be easy

02:43.900 --> 02:45.160
to win him over.

02:45.180 --> 02:46.840
Besides that,

02:47.700 --> 02:48.990
we have to make Shen Zhong

02:49.010 --> 02:50.600
tell us about the smuggler.

02:50.620 --> 02:52.070
It's even harder.

02:52.090 --> 02:53.610
I want to have a try.

02:53.780 --> 02:54.920
Well,

02:55.260 --> 02:56.710
I don't have many to trust.

02:56.730 --> 02:57.830
Don't tell anyone about

02:57.850 --> 02:59.430
our words today.

02:59.450 --> 03:00.810
Your Excellency, do feel relieved.

03:01.060 --> 03:02.530
Your Excellency.

03:04.820 --> 03:07.000
I'm not much of a speaker,

03:07.180 --> 03:10.160
but if you really want to climb up,

03:10.180 --> 03:13.890
I can be your ladder.

03:14.730 --> 03:16.040
Wang Qinian,

03:16.490 --> 03:18.200
what do you live for?

03:18.700 --> 03:19.550
For my wife and daughter

03:19.570 --> 03:21.480
of course.

03:21.570 --> 03:23.170
Well said.

03:29.420 --> 03:32.170
You're not a ladder, but a partner.

03:42.620 --> 03:44.730
My Lady, His Excellency Shen is in front.

03:56.370 --> 03:57.810
Brother!

04:09.700 --> 04:11.690
You went to see him again!

04:11.930 --> 04:13.890
You shouldn't have!

04:19.540 --> 04:21.160
Our parents passed away early.

04:22.460 --> 04:24.600
They left you in my care,

04:25.020 --> 04:26.050
so that I can take good care of you

04:26.050 --> 04:28.250
and protect you.

04:30.460 --> 04:31.610
I don't want to stop you

04:31.610 --> 04:33.850
from seeking the man you love,

04:34.420 --> 04:36.370
but Yan Bingyun

04:37.420 --> 04:39.260
can only hurt you.

04:39.260 --> 04:39.770
Brother,

04:39.770 --> 04:42.290
that would be my last time to see him.

04:42.540 --> 04:44.600
I have broken off with him.

04:52.890 --> 04:54.760
Did he say anything to break your heart?

04:57.050 --> 04:58.320
I'll find him.

04:59.170 --> 04:59.890
Don't!

04:59.890 --> 05:02.320
You still can't forget him!

05:04.420 --> 05:05.760
Brother,

05:05.860 --> 05:07.810
just give me a few more days.

05:08.420 --> 05:09.590
I will forget him

05:09.610 --> 05:12.720
bit by bit.

05:29.140 --> 05:30.690
Go home first.

05:31.330 --> 05:32.870
What are you going to do?

05:32.890 --> 05:36.480
Don't worry. I have something to say.

05:36.740 --> 05:38.310
I won't go for Yan Bingyun.

05:38.330 --> 05:39.810
Really?

05:42.050 --> 05:43.570
Brother!

05:45.020 --> 05:46.530
Do feel relieved.

05:48.050 --> 05:49.970
I won't see him anymore.

06:05.580 --> 06:08.920
Fan Xian! Fan Xian!

06:09.700 --> 06:11.320
Your Excellency Shen, you're here.

06:11.860 --> 06:13.130
What's up?

06:20.260 --> 06:20.930
Your Excellency Shen,

06:20.930 --> 06:22.760
what about talking inside?

06:23.260 --> 06:25.120
Don't target at my younger sister.

06:25.140 --> 06:26.590
Your Excellency Shen, you're kidding me.

06:26.610 --> 06:27.460
Your younger sister is actually

06:27.460 --> 06:29.250
targeting at Mr. Yan.

06:29.330 --> 06:30.240
From today on,

06:30.260 --> 06:31.590
I'll lock her up in her room

06:31.610 --> 06:33.280
till you leave Shangjing.

06:33.300 --> 06:35.920
You can lock her up, but you can't lock up her heart.

06:36.210 --> 06:37.640
Do remember my words.

06:37.740 --> 06:40.090
If Yan Bingyun dares seduce her again,

06:40.140 --> 06:41.610
I'll kill him myself

06:41.610 --> 06:43.250
even if I have to lose my rank.

06:43.460 --> 06:44.720
How about this?

06:45.170 --> 06:47.590
Your Excellency Shen, I ask you a question.

06:47.610 --> 06:48.970
If you tell me the answer,

06:49.020 --> 06:50.840
I'll help you kill Yan Bingyun.

06:50.860 --> 06:52.630
I'm not in the mood to joke with you.

06:52.650 --> 06:53.650
Your Excellency Shen, take it easy.

06:53.650 --> 06:55.320
I'm not joking.

06:55.490 --> 06:56.860
I've checked the account book of

06:56.860 --> 06:58.840
our Neiku branch in Shangjing Town.

06:58.860 --> 06:59.910
For so many years,

06:59.930 --> 07:01.070
someone from Nanqing has been

07:01.090 --> 07:02.440
pocketing vast sums of money.

07:02.460 --> 07:04.970
Your Excellency Shen, do you know that?

07:07.460 --> 07:08.520
What if I know?

07:08.540 --> 07:09.630
Good.

07:09.650 --> 07:12.010
Tell me the name and give me the evidence,

07:12.050 --> 07:13.030
I guarantee

07:13.050 --> 07:14.030
your younger sister and Yan Bingyun

07:14.050 --> 07:16.570
won't see each other again.

07:18.260 --> 07:20.240
Aren't you born wise?

07:20.260 --> 07:22.000
If you want to know the name of the smuggler,

07:22.020 --> 07:24.320
why not make a guess?

07:27.170 --> 07:29.480
Your Excellency Shen, so you don't want to tell me.

07:29.700 --> 07:31.090
What can you do

07:31.140 --> 07:32.580
if I don't tell you?

07:32.580 --> 07:34.440
Then I have to do something.

07:34.610 --> 07:35.800
I'll wait and see.

07:35.820 --> 07:36.490
I'm afraid by then,

07:36.490 --> 07:37.870
there's no way back for everyone.

07:37.890 --> 07:39.410
That's most welcome.

07:39.610 --> 07:41.920
Your Excellency Fan, I'll leave first.

07:42.610 --> 07:44.160
I'll wait for your moves.

07:46.170 --> 07:47.610
I will try my best

07:47.610 --> 07:49.290
not to disappoint you.

07:53.890 --> 07:55.410
Cunning as he is,

07:55.650 --> 07:57.760
he won't tell you the name.

07:59.770 --> 08:02.840
Everyone will change when coming to a dead end.

08:02.860 --> 08:04.840
Trusted by Empress Dowager of Beiqi

08:04.860 --> 08:07.010
and controlling the Embroidered Uniform Guards,

08:07.540 --> 08:08.720
how could he

08:08.740 --> 08:10.570
ever come to a dead end?

08:10.610 --> 08:11.970
Rest and heal.

08:15.580 --> 08:16.520
Where are you going?

08:16.540 --> 08:18.160
To see Shangshan Hu.

08:18.540 --> 08:20.040
How dare you see him?

08:20.140 --> 08:21.400
He will kill you.

08:21.420 --> 08:23.530
Maybe I should buy him some gifts.

08:38.170 --> 08:40.030
Find some reliable guards

08:40.050 --> 08:42.030
to guard my mansion.

08:42.050 --> 08:43.240
Don't let her

08:43.260 --> 08:44.590
get out these days.

08:44.610 --> 08:45.920
I see.

08:46.850 --> 08:48.130
Your Excellency, we've got information

08:48.580 --> 08:50.080
from our man watching the mission.

08:50.100 --> 08:52.200
Fan Xian went out right after you left.

08:52.220 --> 08:53.560
Where did he go?

08:53.580 --> 08:54.960
Go shopping.

08:56.140 --> 08:57.600
Shopping for what?

09:01.410 --> 09:03.690
This one is really exquisite.

09:03.850 --> 09:05.400
Sir, you're right.

09:06.460 --> 09:08.450
The color looks joyful.

09:10.050 --> 09:10.970
Boss,

09:10.970 --> 09:12.590
do you sell coffins?

09:12.610 --> 09:14.320
Yes, coffins are in the backyard.

09:14.340 --> 09:15.660
Sir, you can go and pick.

09:15.660 --> 09:17.080
No hurry.

09:17.100 --> 09:18.960
I'll have a look at these.

09:19.780 --> 09:20.580
Excuse me,

09:20.580 --> 09:22.640
did any of your relatives or friends pass away?

09:22.660 --> 09:23.840
No.

09:24.780 --> 09:26.000
Then why do you buy coffins?

09:26.020 --> 09:27.650
As gifts.

09:29.260 --> 09:30.270
If I buy many coffins,

09:30.290 --> 09:31.890
will you deliver them for me?

09:39.930 --> 09:42.520
Grand General, something weird happens.

09:42.780 --> 09:44.350
A man sends many coffins

09:44.370 --> 09:45.880
and funeral stuff here

09:45.900 --> 09:47.450
and piles them outside.

09:47.780 --> 09:49.830
He says he is here to send gifts.

09:49.850 --> 09:51.470
The gatekeeper finds him crazy

09:51.490 --> 09:52.470
and wants to kick him away,

09:52.490 --> 09:54.120
but he insists on seeing you.

09:54.140 --> 09:55.120
Does he say his name?

09:55.140 --> 09:57.520
He says he's called Fan Xian.

09:59.260 --> 10:01.210
Fan Xian?

10:01.410 --> 10:02.390
Fan Xian has sent coffins

10:02.410 --> 10:04.640
to the door of Shangshan Hu's residence?

10:04.660 --> 10:05.920
Yes.

10:06.780 --> 10:07.660
He got Shangshan Hu's guards killed,

10:07.660 --> 10:09.370
and now he's acting provocatively.

10:10.530 --> 10:12.510
Where's Fan Xian? Has he left?

10:12.530 --> 10:14.920
No, he wants to see Shangshan Hu.

10:18.660 --> 10:21.280
He's seeking death.

10:24.900 --> 10:26.410
Grand General, on hearing that

10:26.410 --> 10:27.350
your guards were all killed,

10:27.370 --> 10:28.880
I feel so sorry.

10:28.900 --> 10:29.800
I bought coffins

10:29.820 --> 10:31.270
to see them off.

10:31.290 --> 10:33.470
I hope that you can take care of yourself

10:33.490 --> 10:34.960
and restrain your grief.

10:35.660 --> 10:37.210
Leave us.

10:47.850 --> 10:49.240
It's good you're here.

10:49.260 --> 10:50.510
I guess so.

10:50.530 --> 10:52.210
Save the coffins.

10:52.460 --> 10:54.210
Your head would make

10:54.490 --> 10:56.710
a perfect gift to see Tan Wu and others off.

10:56.730 --> 10:57.880
Grand General,

10:57.900 --> 10:59.440
Shen Zhong is the one who got them killed.

10:59.460 --> 11:02.720
No hurry. I'll take you down one by one.

11:10.020 --> 11:11.560
I'm not here to fight.

11:11.580 --> 11:13.080
Just let me kill you.

11:16.410 --> 11:18.050
Wait! I have something to say.

11:18.050 --> 11:19.720
Tell me in my dreams after you die.

11:20.050 --> 11:20.700
Don't you want to know

11:20.700 --> 11:22.280
where Xiao En is?

11:24.930 --> 11:25.730
You prepared Xiao En's

11:25.730 --> 11:26.680
substitute in advance.

11:26.700 --> 11:27.730
you asked him to change clothes

11:27.730 --> 11:28.910
and hide among the dead.

11:28.930 --> 11:30.840
I discovered that by chance

11:31.530 --> 11:33.130
and followed him all along.

11:33.260 --> 11:34.270
Don't you want to know

11:34.290 --> 11:35.840
what happened later?

11:36.610 --> 11:38.280
Where is my adoptive father?

11:38.370 --> 11:39.720
He's dead.

11:43.100 --> 11:44.640
Shen Zhong killed him.

11:44.660 --> 11:45.840
What?

11:47.050 --> 11:49.000
Shen Zhong was prepared in advance.

11:49.020 --> 11:50.100
He ordered He Daoren and Langtao

11:50.100 --> 11:51.510
to stop and kill Xiao En secretly.

11:51.530 --> 11:52.830
Langtao broke off Master Xiao's

11:52.850 --> 11:54.840
heart arteries and veins.

11:55.850 --> 11:57.150
It was Shen Zhong who planned

11:57.170 --> 11:59.370
the whole thing!

12:00.970 --> 12:02.800
I'll have Langtao

12:02.820 --> 12:04.390
and He Daoren guarding in the dark.

12:04.410 --> 12:06.080
If someone really tries to

12:06.100 --> 12:07.600
replace Xiao En secretly,

12:07.730 --> 12:09.390
only with two Ninth Dan masters joining hands

12:09.410 --> 12:12.250
can we really eliminate a hidden danger.

12:26.970 --> 12:28.650
I accompanied Master Xiao

12:28.820 --> 12:30.570
when he was dying.

12:32.170 --> 12:34.130
He left some words for you.

12:34.780 --> 12:36.010
Tell me.

12:36.530 --> 12:38.810
Master Xiao asked me to tell you.

12:41.340 --> 12:43.650
After I die, let me sit here.

12:44.340 --> 12:45.810
Don't bury me.

12:47.530 --> 12:51.520
I don't want to be buried under the ground ever again.

12:52.290 --> 12:54.040
No need to avenge my death.

12:54.780 --> 12:56.920
Don't provoke Chen Pingping.

12:57.730 --> 12:59.890
Bury everything deep in your heart,

13:00.780 --> 13:02.400
and live a happy life.

13:04.660 --> 13:06.520
Don't avenge his death!

13:07.260 --> 13:09.250
Don't provoke Shen Zhong!

13:11.220 --> 13:12.490
Bury everything

13:12.490 --> 13:13.920
deep in your heart,

13:14.900 --> 13:16.810
and live a happy life.

13:18.930 --> 13:20.400
Father!

13:29.220 --> 13:33.270
By killing my father, he's become my mortal enemy.

13:33.290 --> 13:34.370
How can I let go of him easily?

13:34.370 --> 13:36.280
But how can you do that?

13:37.490 --> 13:38.810
Grand General,

13:39.050 --> 13:40.600
I've thought it for you.

13:40.850 --> 13:43.320
Shen Zhong is a high-rank official with enormous power,

13:43.340 --> 13:44.770
while you're trapped

13:45.370 --> 13:47.200
in Shangjing

13:47.220 --> 13:48.440
with no guards around.

13:48.460 --> 13:49.460
You stand no chance

13:49.460 --> 13:50.440
to kill him.

13:50.460 --> 13:52.050
I can fight his guards and kill him on the street.

13:52.050 --> 13:52.930
Then Grand General,

13:52.930 --> 13:54.050
you'll be sentenced to death for sure.

13:54.050 --> 13:54.910
I'm not afraid to die.

13:54.930 --> 13:55.930
Master Xiao's last wish

13:55.930 --> 13:58.040
is for you to live a happy life.

13:59.100 --> 14:00.690
You might not be afraid to die,

14:01.700 --> 14:03.160
but who will mourn Master Xiao

14:04.660 --> 14:07.010
if you die?

14:19.930 --> 14:22.480
Now in the entire Shangjing Town,

14:23.700 --> 14:26.040
I'm the only one who can help you

14:27.730 --> 14:30.010
kill Shen Zhong.

14:45.780 --> 14:47.930
Shangshan Hu didn't kill Fan Xian

14:47.930 --> 14:49.770
but left his residence with Fan Xian instead.

14:50.050 --> 14:52.330
It's true! Indeed!

14:52.970 --> 14:54.320
Where did they go?

14:54.340 --> 14:55.710
According to the direction,

14:55.730 --> 14:57.450
it must be the imperial palace.

14:57.900 --> 14:59.400
The imperial palace?

15:23.340 --> 15:26.710
I thought you come to visit His Majesty.

15:26.730 --> 15:29.280
How come you're here?

15:29.580 --> 15:31.160
Your Majesty,

15:31.340 --> 15:32.900
after visiting you last time,

15:32.900 --> 15:35.030
I find you graceful and poised,

15:35.050 --> 15:36.270
kind and respected.

15:36.290 --> 15:37.800
Having lost my mom when I was little,

15:37.820 --> 15:39.830
I can't help admiring you.

15:39.850 --> 15:41.200
I keep thinking about

15:41.220 --> 15:42.440
visiting you again.

15:42.460 --> 15:45.450
Today, I finally fulfilled my wish.

15:49.610 --> 15:51.160
I'm sorry!

15:53.850 --> 15:55.330
Just be careful.

15:55.530 --> 15:57.400
Thank you, Your Majesty.

15:59.100 --> 16:00.720
Is that all?

16:01.970 --> 16:03.270
Your Majesty,

16:03.290 --> 16:04.350
I've been racking my brains

16:04.370 --> 16:05.640
these days,

16:05.660 --> 16:07.830
trying to figure out

16:07.850 --> 16:08.530
what gift I shall prepare

16:08.530 --> 16:10.480
for your birthday.

16:10.530 --> 16:11.880
It's just for fun.

16:11.900 --> 16:14.560
No need to bring me a gift.

16:14.580 --> 16:16.000
I won't forgive myself

16:16.020 --> 16:17.570
if I bring no gift.

16:17.700 --> 16:19.680
Neither will I forgive myself

16:19.700 --> 16:21.270
if my gift is similar to other's.

16:21.290 --> 16:21.930
I have to find a gift

16:21.930 --> 16:24.200
unmatched in the world.

16:24.220 --> 16:25.830
So you've found it?

16:25.850 --> 16:26.880
Yes.

16:26.900 --> 16:28.800
Your Majesty, I feel so happy

16:28.820 --> 16:30.440
to find the gift.

16:30.460 --> 16:32.390
I can hardly wait till your birthday,

16:32.410 --> 16:34.960
so I bring the gift to you today.

16:35.460 --> 16:36.760
Such being the case,

16:36.780 --> 16:38.370
just show me.

16:38.900 --> 16:40.080
Yes.

16:42.460 --> 16:45.640
Grand General! Grand General!

16:45.660 --> 16:47.400
Her Majesty asks you to come in.

16:56.220 --> 16:57.810
I can help you.

16:58.140 --> 16:58.970
But Grand General,

16:58.970 --> 17:00.960
to avenge your father's death,

17:01.580 --> 17:03.280
you have to put aside your dignity.

17:03.580 --> 17:06.530
You have no choice other than that.

17:12.290 --> 17:16.320
Minister Shangshan Hu pays respect to Your Majesty.

17:16.890 --> 17:19.290
What's this about?

17:20.100 --> 17:21.480
Your Majesty,

17:21.500 --> 17:22.750
he is the gift

17:22.770 --> 17:24.840
I prepare for your birthday.

17:30.530 --> 17:31.890
What?

17:32.530 --> 17:34.150
Fan Xian gave Shangshan Hu to Her Majesty

17:34.170 --> 17:35.990
as her birthday gift?

17:36.010 --> 17:36.910
Your Excellency,

17:36.930 --> 17:38.600
I also thought I heard it wrong.

17:38.620 --> 17:40.930
But after confirming many times, it's really the case.

17:40.980 --> 17:42.360
Then what?

17:42.380 --> 17:43.230
Then Fan Xian said he wanted to

17:43.250 --> 17:44.750
speak with Her Majesty alone.

17:44.770 --> 17:45.580
So Her Majesty

17:45.580 --> 17:46.750
asked everyone else to leave.

17:46.770 --> 17:47.410
Our agent

17:47.410 --> 17:48.750
dared not to stay of course.

17:48.770 --> 17:49.720
So we don't know

17:49.740 --> 17:51.320
what they would say later.

17:55.010 --> 17:57.010
Reporting to Her Majesty alone,

17:57.410 --> 17:59.440
but he's the minister of the enemy country!

18:00.050 --> 18:01.390
The Saintess is also inside the Hall.

18:01.410 --> 18:02.960
There should be no danger.

18:05.130 --> 18:07.720
It's such a weird move.

18:09.290 --> 18:11.720
Giving Shangshan Hu away as the birthday gift,

18:12.100 --> 18:13.770
what kind of a trick is that?

18:14.410 --> 18:16.560
Your Excellency Shen, so you don't want to tell me.

18:16.700 --> 18:17.990
What can you do

18:18.010 --> 18:19.510
if I don't tell you?

18:19.530 --> 18:21.270
Then I have to do something.

18:21.290 --> 18:22.960
I'll wait and see.

18:23.890 --> 18:25.480
I'll wait for your moves.

18:28.250 --> 18:29.680
No,

18:30.890 --> 18:33.080
I have to stop him!

18:34.290 --> 18:35.100
Get the horse ready. I'm going to the imperial palace.

18:35.100 --> 18:36.410
Yes.

18:44.740 --> 18:46.510
As the Grand General,

18:46.530 --> 18:49.390
you don't have to kowtow when meeting me.

18:49.410 --> 18:51.050
Rise.

18:56.340 --> 18:57.480
What's going on?
=Empress Dowager of Beiqi=

18:57.480 --> 18:58.230
What's going on?

18:58.250 --> 19:00.170
I didn't lie to Your Majesty.

19:00.410 --> 19:02.250
The Grand General

19:02.250 --> 19:04.010
is my gift for you.

19:04.980 --> 19:05.890
Nonsense!

19:05.890 --> 19:07.270
It took me some time

19:07.290 --> 19:08.630
to persuade the Grand General

19:08.650 --> 19:10.600
to follow Your Majesty.

19:11.580 --> 19:14.390
I pledge allegiance to Your Majesty today.

19:14.410 --> 19:15.600
From now on,

19:15.620 --> 19:17.770
I will be at your disposal.

19:18.250 --> 19:19.720
Grand General, you're

19:19.740 --> 19:21.370
an important general of our country.

19:21.500 --> 19:23.770
Why do you pledge allegiance again?

19:24.380 --> 19:25.800
Before now,

19:25.820 --> 19:28.130
he was not so loyal

19:28.130 --> 19:30.250
to Your Majesty and His Majesty.

19:30.580 --> 19:32.720
With a wise emperor and virtuous ministers,

19:32.740 --> 19:34.230
Beiqi is prosperous.

19:34.250 --> 19:37.150
How can the Grand General not be loyal to His Majesty?

19:37.170 --> 19:38.270
Your Majesty,

19:38.290 --> 19:39.910
there're only a few people in the Hall.

19:39.930 --> 19:42.370
Let's be honest.

19:43.460 --> 19:45.650
How honest?

19:46.500 --> 19:48.840
If His Majesty really trusts the Grand General,

19:48.930 --> 19:51.080
why would His Majesty

19:51.100 --> 19:54.080
transfer him away from the border troops
and trap him in Shangjing?

19:57.010 --> 19:58.440
Moreover, Your Majesty,

19:58.460 --> 20:00.680
you work your heart out for Beiqi,

20:00.700 --> 20:02.250
but His Majesty

20:02.740 --> 20:04.840
is not convinced.

20:05.500 --> 20:06.840
You do everything for the benefits of Beiqi,

20:06.860 --> 20:08.680
but His Majesty is actually suspicious of you.

20:08.700 --> 20:09.960
By seeing that,

20:09.980 --> 20:11.870
I also feel emotional.

20:11.890 --> 20:13.680
How dare you!

20:13.700 --> 20:16.510
You try to pit me against His Majesty with your silver tongue.

20:16.530 --> 20:18.580
Do you really think I dare not to kill you?

20:18.580 --> 20:19.750
Your Majesty, no hurry.

20:19.770 --> 20:22.440
If you want to kill me, just wait till I finish my words.

20:24.130 --> 20:26.080
After analyzing the current situation

20:26.100 --> 20:27.360
with the Grand General openly,

20:27.380 --> 20:29.410
he finally realized his errors

20:29.410 --> 20:30.800
and decided to return to the correct path.

20:30.820 --> 20:31.910
Your Majesty, it seems that

20:31.930 --> 20:35.010
the border troops are under your control.

20:36.220 --> 20:38.560
You persuaded the Grand General to serve me?

20:38.580 --> 20:39.910
Exactly.

20:39.930 --> 20:42.390
And Shangshan Hu just listened to you?

20:42.410 --> 20:44.200
He didn't listen to me.

20:44.460 --> 20:46.560
He was pushed by the general trend.

20:47.620 --> 20:49.440
Which trend?

20:49.460 --> 20:50.800
Your Majesty,

20:51.050 --> 20:52.230
tricked by Shen Zhong,

20:52.250 --> 20:54.150
Shangshan Hu lost

20:54.170 --> 20:55.960
all his guards.

20:55.980 --> 20:56.770
After that,

20:56.770 --> 20:58.320
he was alone and helpless in Shangjing Town.

20:58.340 --> 21:00.110
If he doesn't find a patron now,

21:00.130 --> 21:02.480
should he really wait to die?

21:10.530 --> 21:11.630
I remember a story

21:11.650 --> 21:14.480
told by the late emperor.

21:16.050 --> 21:17.270
I'd be glad to hear it.

21:17.290 --> 21:19.360
Defeated and driven into a corner,

21:19.380 --> 21:21.960
a Grand General pledged allegiance to his opponent.

21:22.290 --> 21:23.010
What then?

21:23.010 --> 21:24.230
Then?

21:24.250 --> 21:26.460
Then he took the opportunity

21:26.460 --> 21:27.960
to escape, staged a comeback

21:27.980 --> 21:31.010
and rebuilt his army.

21:34.170 --> 21:35.010
Fan Xian.

21:35.010 --> 21:36.290
Yes.

21:36.460 --> 21:38.480
It's easy to bend a man's knees,

21:38.770 --> 21:42.650
but it's hard to predict his mind.

21:43.770 --> 21:45.080
The story is good.

21:46.290 --> 21:47.960
Grand General, what do you think?

22:21.620 --> 22:23.360
What's this?

22:23.380 --> 22:24.360
The names of

22:24.380 --> 22:25.990
all my trusted subordinates

22:26.010 --> 22:27.560
in the army are on it.

22:30.340 --> 22:31.910
From generals who lead the army

22:31.930 --> 22:33.390
to military officers of different battalions,

22:33.410 --> 22:34.560
no one is left.

22:34.580 --> 22:36.080
As one man, it's impossible

22:36.100 --> 22:39.050
to control the entire army on my own.

22:39.170 --> 22:40.170
These generals and military officers

22:40.170 --> 22:42.460
form the foundation for me

22:42.460 --> 22:45.840
to command the army as I wish.

22:46.380 --> 22:49.560
You actually hand over the foundation you've laid

22:49.580 --> 22:51.510
for commanding the army over the years?

22:51.530 --> 22:56.080
Otherwise, how can I show my allegiance to Your Majesty?

23:00.580 --> 23:02.820
Your Majesty, congratulations!

23:02.820 --> 23:04.320
Now with the loyalty of a brave general,

23:04.340 --> 23:06.770
the turbulent situations can be settled. It's so...

23:12.170 --> 23:13.960
So what?

23:14.740 --> 23:16.600
So good!

23:17.890 --> 23:19.720
It's not right.

23:19.740 --> 23:22.370
How is Beiqi turbulent?

23:22.500 --> 23:25.080
Your Majesty, whatever you say.

23:27.170 --> 23:28.270
Shangshan Hu.

23:28.290 --> 23:29.560
Yes.

23:30.050 --> 23:33.650
I've seen your sincerity.

23:33.740 --> 23:37.290
Since you want to take my side, do you want anything in return?

23:37.380 --> 23:39.680
Shen Zhong killed my adoptive father with schemes.

23:39.740 --> 23:42.320
Your Majesty, please avenge his death for me.

23:42.930 --> 23:44.290
Xiao En?

23:44.410 --> 23:45.720
Wasn't he taken away

23:45.740 --> 23:46.870
and burnt to death?

23:46.890 --> 23:48.990
How could Shen Zhong kill him?

23:49.010 --> 23:50.290
I'm so sorry.

23:50.980 --> 23:52.630
My adoptive father was saved

23:52.650 --> 23:54.720
by my guards.

23:55.530 --> 23:57.960
Aren't you afraid I might punish you?

23:57.980 --> 23:59.600
I'm willing to take punishments.

24:01.250 --> 24:02.720
Go ahead.

24:03.050 --> 24:05.150
I planned to replace my adoptive father

24:05.170 --> 24:07.440
and help him escape,

24:07.620 --> 24:09.390
but Shen Zhong was prepared in advance.

24:09.410 --> 24:10.170
He asked He Daoren

24:10.170 --> 24:11.680
and Langtao to join hands

24:11.700 --> 24:13.960
in killing my adoptive father.

24:15.170 --> 24:16.530
Your Majesty,

24:16.620 --> 24:19.840
Shen Zhong and I are absolutely irreconcilable.

24:20.340 --> 24:22.960
That's not what Shen Zhong said.

24:24.130 --> 24:25.750
We'll know the truth

24:25.770 --> 24:27.800
by asking He Daoren

24:27.980 --> 24:30.290
and Langtao.

24:42.500 --> 24:44.170
Mr. He.

24:45.930 --> 24:47.480
Mr. He, where are you going?

24:47.500 --> 24:48.840
Her Majesty wants to see me.

24:49.460 --> 24:51.270
Good, I also want to see Her Majesty.

24:51.290 --> 24:52.480
Let's go together.

24:52.740 --> 24:53.560
Your Excellency Shen, please.

24:53.580 --> 24:54.770
Please.

25:14.890 --> 25:17.150
Your Majesty, He Daoren is here.

25:17.170 --> 25:18.770
Commander Shen is...

25:23.010 --> 25:24.840
Your Majesty.

25:25.340 --> 25:26.800
Rise.

25:29.100 --> 25:30.800
Your Majesty, you're really wise and farsighted.

25:31.100 --> 25:32.910
By inviting His Excellency Shen to confront face-to-face,

25:32.930 --> 25:34.560
no loyal minister will be wronged.

25:34.620 --> 25:35.800
Your Excellency Fan, what trick

25:36.130 --> 25:38.170
are you playing now?

25:38.410 --> 25:40.030
Your Excellency Shen, don't you know?

25:40.050 --> 25:42.200
As you really summoned by Her Majesty?

25:43.530 --> 25:44.500
Sorry! Sorry!

25:44.500 --> 25:46.320
I saw His Excellency Shen come straight

25:46.340 --> 25:48.130
to the Hall without reporting.

25:49.250 --> 25:51.080
So I guessed wrong. Sorry.

25:51.100 --> 25:52.080
Your Majesty,

25:52.100 --> 25:53.630
Fan Xian is cunning.

25:53.650 --> 25:54.910
I'm too worried about you

25:54.930 --> 25:56.110
to wait for reporting.

25:56.130 --> 25:58.080
Please forgive me.

25:58.100 --> 26:01.150
You're the most trustworthy minister of Beiqi

26:01.170 --> 26:02.990
with ardent loyalty.

26:03.010 --> 26:04.700
Why should I blame you?

26:04.700 --> 26:06.290
It's not so easy

26:06.290 --> 26:09.680
to pit me against you.

26:10.530 --> 26:13.250
Your Majesty, I'm wronged. I didn't do that.

26:13.740 --> 26:15.080
Mr. He.

26:15.100 --> 26:15.770
I'm so flattered.

26:15.770 --> 26:17.630
Your Majesty, please call me by my name.

26:17.650 --> 26:18.980
According to Shangshan Hu,

26:18.980 --> 26:20.250
you and Langtao

26:20.250 --> 26:22.250
were ordered by His Excellency Shen

26:22.250 --> 26:24.050
to kill Xiao En?

26:24.930 --> 26:26.290
Well...

26:27.460 --> 26:29.770
Is it true?

26:38.380 --> 26:41.230
No matter what the truth is,

26:41.250 --> 26:43.600
I won't blame

26:43.620 --> 26:45.370
Commander Shen.

26:46.380 --> 26:48.600
Feel relieved to tell the truth.

26:56.890 --> 26:59.530
Her Majesty is asking you. Why are you hesitating?

26:59.740 --> 27:01.080
I did receive order

27:01.100 --> 27:03.320
from His Excellency Shen to kill Xiao En.

27:04.530 --> 27:06.080
Commander Shen,

27:06.100 --> 27:08.270
I remember telling you

27:08.290 --> 27:10.840
to spare Xiao En's life.

27:12.820 --> 27:14.480
I acknowledge my sin.

27:23.460 --> 27:25.360
Now thinking back,

27:25.380 --> 27:28.110
I didn't think it through.

27:28.130 --> 27:30.960
Commander Shen, by imprisoning Xiao En,

27:30.980 --> 27:32.390
you became his enemy.

27:32.410 --> 27:34.560
Of course you would worry that

27:34.580 --> 27:36.320
you might be in danger if Xiao En was alive.

27:36.620 --> 27:40.680
You killed him to protect yourself.

27:41.460 --> 27:43.230
Your Majesty, I'm willing to take punishments.

27:43.250 --> 27:45.770
I know you're loyal.

27:45.820 --> 27:47.480
Rise.

27:50.820 --> 27:52.080
Well,

27:52.100 --> 27:53.820
do I have to issue an imperial edict

27:53.820 --> 27:55.440
to make you stand up?

27:59.170 --> 28:00.770
Grand General.

28:01.700 --> 28:02.720
Yes.

28:02.740 --> 28:04.910
I know you love Xiao En

28:04.930 --> 28:06.440
deeply as a son,

28:06.460 --> 28:08.510
and I know you have a grudge

28:08.530 --> 28:10.370
against Shen Zhong.

28:10.460 --> 28:12.630
But now Beiqi faces domestic strife

28:12.650 --> 28:14.720
and foreign aggression.

28:15.010 --> 28:16.750
For the sake of our country,

28:16.770 --> 28:18.270
I hope you can

28:18.290 --> 28:20.360
let go of resentment

28:20.380 --> 28:24.250
and make concerted efforts to defend Shangjing and our country.

28:41.620 --> 28:44.320
I'm willing to defend my country.

28:45.410 --> 28:46.960
Good.

28:48.410 --> 28:50.050
Rise.

28:52.050 --> 28:53.600
Commander Shen.

28:53.620 --> 28:54.100
Yes.

28:54.100 --> 28:56.600
The Grand General has let go of resentment

28:56.620 --> 28:58.270
and offered service to the imperial court.

28:58.290 --> 29:00.600
It's a blessing to Beiqi,

29:00.620 --> 29:02.930
and a blessing from our ancestors.

29:03.220 --> 29:06.930
I'm really happy.

29:12.650 --> 29:15.530
Fan Xian, as to you,

29:15.820 --> 29:17.650
you've rendered great service by persuading the Grand General.

29:18.050 --> 29:19.680
You've really given thoughts

29:19.700 --> 29:21.870
to my gift.

29:21.890 --> 29:25.800
I owe you for that.

29:25.820 --> 29:27.480
I'm so flattered.

29:31.220 --> 29:32.510
Your Excellency Shen,

29:32.530 --> 29:34.270
I am the one who persuaded the Grand General.

29:34.290 --> 29:35.100
From today on,

29:35.100 --> 29:36.800
you two are colleagues.

29:36.820 --> 29:38.960
Try to be good buddies.

29:42.530 --> 29:43.800
Your Majesty,

29:43.820 --> 29:46.770
I have another birthday gift for you.

29:47.460 --> 29:49.130
What's that?

30:04.530 --> 30:06.600
It's Neiku's branch in Shangjing Town,

30:06.620 --> 30:08.440
which belongs to the imperial family of Nanqing.

30:09.500 --> 30:11.720
I know that.

30:11.740 --> 30:13.320
Please let me explain.

30:13.340 --> 30:14.800
When I return to Nanqing,

30:14.820 --> 30:16.100
I'll take over

30:16.100 --> 30:17.960
the financial power of Neiku.

30:18.250 --> 30:20.600
Marrying the princess and taking over the financial power,

30:20.930 --> 30:23.410
I've heard of that long ago.

30:23.770 --> 30:25.130
Nothing in the world

30:25.130 --> 30:26.480
can escape Your Majesty's eyes.

30:26.500 --> 30:29.480
How is it relevant to my birthday gift?

30:32.340 --> 30:34.440
When Li Yunrui was in charge of Neiku,

30:34.460 --> 30:37.600
she smuggled goods with Beiqi secretly to gain profits.

30:38.170 --> 30:38.740
Now,

30:38.740 --> 30:40.480
since I'm going to take over Neiku,

30:40.700 --> 30:42.960
it's a pity to hand in

30:42.980 --> 30:44.680
such a large sum of money.

30:44.770 --> 30:45.910
In my opinion,

30:45.930 --> 30:46.910
we can keep doing

30:46.930 --> 30:48.480
the business.

30:48.500 --> 30:50.320
I'll take over the business.

30:50.340 --> 30:52.270
Your Majesty, I beg your approval.

30:52.290 --> 30:53.360
As to the profit,

30:53.380 --> 30:55.600
I'll give 30% to the imperial family of Beiqi.

30:55.620 --> 30:56.750
Take it

30:56.770 --> 30:58.220
as my gift

30:58.220 --> 30:59.770
for your birthday.

31:00.770 --> 31:03.530
What profit from smuggling?

31:04.740 --> 31:06.200
Well, Your Majesty,

31:07.580 --> 31:09.480
don't you know?

31:10.050 --> 31:12.030
Our Nanqing Neiku's branch

31:12.050 --> 31:14.370
has been cooperating with His Excellency Shen to gain profits.

31:14.500 --> 31:17.130
It's a lot of money.

31:18.290 --> 31:19.380
Your Excellency Shen,

31:19.380 --> 31:21.200
haven't you told Her Majesty yet?

31:22.860 --> 31:24.650
Commander Shen.

31:32.820 --> 31:34.170
Your Majesty,

31:34.740 --> 31:36.110
the accounts of Neiku's branch

31:36.130 --> 31:37.620
were falsified,

31:37.620 --> 31:39.150
but the money

31:39.170 --> 31:41.200
had flowed into Nanqing.

31:42.050 --> 31:45.200
The Embroidered Uniform Guards didn't gain profits from that.

31:46.250 --> 31:47.510
Really?

31:47.530 --> 31:49.320
I can assure that with my life.

31:49.340 --> 31:52.360
Your Majesty, please investigate the secret files of
the Embroidered Uniform Guards thoroughly.

31:52.380 --> 31:54.870
I've never made profits from it.

31:54.890 --> 31:56.320
No need to investigate.

31:56.700 --> 31:59.080
Of course I trust you.

31:59.100 --> 32:00.980
It turns out Your Excellency Shen is so warm-hearted

32:00.980 --> 32:02.150
as to help others make money.

32:02.170 --> 32:03.340
Doing good deeds and accumulating virtues this way,

32:03.340 --> 32:05.170
you're really admirable.

32:07.010 --> 32:08.370
Your Majesty,

32:08.820 --> 32:10.030
the smuggling is related to

32:10.050 --> 32:12.510
high-rank officials of Nanqing.

32:12.530 --> 32:14.480
I thought by conniving at it,

32:14.500 --> 32:16.270
we've sowed the seeds of

32:16.290 --> 32:18.110
Nanqing's turbulence in future.

32:18.130 --> 32:20.600
So I offered my help

32:20.620 --> 32:22.410
to make it happen.

32:24.100 --> 32:25.910
I see.

32:25.930 --> 32:28.030
It's just a small accident. It's fine.

32:28.050 --> 32:29.620
When I take over Neiku,

32:29.620 --> 32:31.860
we can keep doing the business.

32:31.860 --> 32:32.620
Your Majesty,

32:32.620 --> 32:35.050
you can still gain profits from it.

32:35.050 --> 32:37.800
As a Nanqing minister,

32:37.820 --> 32:40.650
why smuggle goods with Beiqi?

32:40.860 --> 32:42.270
It's such a large sum of money.

32:42.290 --> 32:43.360
Even if I hand it in,

32:43.380 --> 32:45.130
it'll do me no good.

32:45.500 --> 32:47.480
Why not gain profits together?

32:47.740 --> 32:50.650
I'm a bit greedy. Sorry.

32:50.820 --> 32:54.200
Pay more attention to that.

32:54.220 --> 32:55.480
Arrange it properly

32:55.500 --> 32:57.560
before you leave.

32:57.860 --> 33:00.250
I need another favor.

33:00.890 --> 33:02.080
Go ahead.

33:02.100 --> 33:04.530
Please ask His Excellency Shen to tell me

33:04.530 --> 33:06.110
the name of the smuggler

33:06.130 --> 33:07.600
in the imperial court of Nanqing.

33:07.620 --> 33:09.170
No way!

33:10.340 --> 33:11.680
Your Excellency Shen,

33:11.700 --> 33:13.320
by taking over Neiku after returning to Nanqing,

33:13.340 --> 33:15.230
I pretty much cut off his source of income.

33:15.250 --> 33:17.360
He certainly hates me to the core.

33:17.380 --> 33:18.800
Your Excellency Shen, tell me his name

33:18.820 --> 33:20.220
so I can protect myself.

33:20.220 --> 33:22.410
Then our business can last long.

33:23.580 --> 33:24.800
Your Majesty,

33:24.820 --> 33:26.870
the smuggler is of great importance.

33:26.890 --> 33:28.910
If he rises in rebellion someday,
Nanqing will be a mess for sure.

33:28.930 --> 33:29.980
By then,

33:29.980 --> 33:31.460
It'll be a good opportunity for us.

33:31.460 --> 33:33.800
We can't give him away now!

33:33.820 --> 33:35.320
Don't worry.

33:35.740 --> 33:37.840
I'm not a silly old fool.

33:38.170 --> 33:40.750
Shen Zhong has made it clear.

33:40.770 --> 33:42.220
The smuggler

33:42.220 --> 33:43.750
in the imperial court of Nanqing

33:43.770 --> 33:46.510
has nothing to do with Beiqi.

33:46.530 --> 33:48.960
No need to ask him anymore.

33:49.050 --> 33:50.390
I see.

33:50.410 --> 33:52.200
Now that everything has settled,

33:52.410 --> 33:54.480
I'll leave first.

33:55.580 --> 33:57.290
Your Excellency Fan.

34:01.860 --> 34:03.840
I'm confused about one thing.

34:03.860 --> 34:05.560
May I ask you?

34:05.580 --> 34:06.960
Your Excellency Shen, please go ahead.

34:06.980 --> 34:09.000
Your Excellency Fan,
you're so outstanding in literary accomplishments

34:09.250 --> 34:12.430
that you're respected as poetic genius from heaven in Nanqing.

34:12.450 --> 34:13.580
I'm so flattered.

34:13.580 --> 34:16.080
Nanqing boasts strong military forces
but is poor in literary achievements.

34:16.100 --> 34:17.800
Talented as you are,

34:17.820 --> 34:19.030
you're bound to have

34:19.050 --> 34:21.280
a great future in Nanqing.

34:21.490 --> 34:22.970
Thank you for your blessings.

34:23.970 --> 34:26.080
In that sense,

34:26.100 --> 34:29.450
you'll become a nobleman or a minister in the near future.

34:29.490 --> 34:31.190
So I just don't get it.

34:31.210 --> 34:33.160
By smuggling goods from the Neiku of Nanqing,

34:33.180 --> 34:34.560
you can obtain a lot of money.

34:34.580 --> 34:36.450
But money can't buy you

34:36.660 --> 34:39.760
a bright future like that.

34:41.900 --> 34:42.950
By doing so,

34:42.970 --> 34:43.900
you're handing your life

34:43.900 --> 34:46.370
over to Beiqi.

34:47.690 --> 34:49.370
Your Excellency Fan,

34:49.660 --> 34:51.840
are you really so shortsighted

34:51.900 --> 34:54.040
as to value money over life?

34:56.820 --> 34:58.120
Your Majesty,

34:58.140 --> 35:00.800
this is what confuses me.

35:02.730 --> 35:04.410
Fan Xian.

35:05.450 --> 35:07.000
Yes.

35:07.050 --> 35:09.470
Are you going to forsake darkness for light

35:09.490 --> 35:11.690
and join us in Beiqi?

35:13.340 --> 35:16.120
Your Majesty, that's not my plan.

35:16.140 --> 35:18.130
Then what you do

35:18.180 --> 35:20.320
makes no sense.

35:26.290 --> 35:27.970
Actually,

35:29.250 --> 35:31.270
I do have a reason that

35:31.290 --> 35:32.920
I've never told others.

35:32.940 --> 35:34.730
Tell us about it.

35:35.100 --> 35:36.100
Your Majesty, by persuading

35:36.100 --> 35:37.670
the Grand General to serve you

35:37.690 --> 35:39.250
and offering you profits gained from

35:39.250 --> 35:40.320
future smuggling,

35:40.340 --> 35:42.080
I hope to ease our relation

35:42.100 --> 35:44.710
and have more contacts.

35:44.730 --> 35:46.450
Why?

35:50.250 --> 35:53.760
I ask this world: what is love on earth

35:54.340 --> 35:56.650
that binds the lovers up in life and death?

35:57.180 --> 35:58.770
I fell in love with your Saintess

35:58.770 --> 35:59.710
at first sight.

35:59.730 --> 36:01.250
I planed the whole thing carefully

36:01.250 --> 36:02.750
for Miss Duoduo's sake.

36:02.770 --> 36:03.660
Your Majesty,

36:03.660 --> 36:04.100
I'm mad

36:04.100 --> 36:05.800
about Duoduo.

36:06.100 --> 36:08.280
Please give us a chance.

36:38.140 --> 36:38.620
Look.

36:38.620 --> 36:40.320
The tree grows well.

36:40.380 --> 36:41.560
The tree, it...

36:41.580 --> 36:43.320
Well, what is this tree?

36:43.940 --> 36:45.180
This tree looks so beautiful.

36:45.180 --> 36:45.860
This tree...

36:45.860 --> 36:46.450
It's...

36:46.450 --> 36:47.890
It's green.

36:50.900 --> 36:51.800
Well,

36:51.820 --> 36:53.180
before I came to Beiqi,

36:53.180 --> 36:55.190
I thought there would be

36:55.210 --> 36:56.400
no grass

36:56.420 --> 36:58.170
or tree here.

36:58.420 --> 36:59.210
I didn't expect

36:59.210 --> 37:00.820
it's so vibrant here.

37:00.820 --> 37:02.210
It's full of vigor.

37:03.010 --> 37:04.970
Well, how wonderful life is!

37:07.180 --> 37:09.170
Well, you're laughing.

37:11.970 --> 37:13.370
Fell in love with me at first sight?

37:14.290 --> 37:15.860
I couldn't tell that old lady

37:15.860 --> 37:16.490
I did everything

37:16.490 --> 37:18.370
to kill Shen Zhong, right?

37:18.450 --> 37:19.510
I just need an excuse.

37:19.530 --> 37:20.970
Don't take it seriously.

37:21.860 --> 37:24.280
You persuaded Shangshan Hu to follow the Empress Dowager

37:24.450 --> 37:25.880
to kill Shen Zhong?

37:25.900 --> 37:26.950
The Empress Dowager is sure

37:26.970 --> 37:28.180
to be tempted by the military power.

37:28.180 --> 37:30.280
But she won't kill Shen Zhong for that.

37:30.340 --> 37:31.620
Now the border troops

37:31.620 --> 37:32.640
are controlled by the Empress Dowager.

37:32.660 --> 37:34.240
Haven't you gained approval from His Majesty?

37:38.770 --> 37:39.730
This is the name list of

37:39.730 --> 37:41.520
Shangshan Hu's subordinates in the army.

37:41.940 --> 37:42.880
I copied it.

37:42.900 --> 37:44.320
All the men on the list are generals and military officers.

37:44.340 --> 37:45.840
To win them over or crack them down,

37:45.860 --> 37:47.400
to take or lose the military power,

37:47.420 --> 37:49.600
it's up to His Majesty.

37:55.140 --> 37:58.000
Well, I didn't do you harm, right?

37:59.490 --> 38:01.670
But Shen Zhong is still safe and sound.

38:01.690 --> 38:04.450
Shen Zhong is talented and confident.

38:04.530 --> 38:05.920
That is his strength,

38:05.940 --> 38:07.800
but it might also get him killed.

38:07.970 --> 38:10.710
Your Majesty, Fan Xian is

38:10.730 --> 38:11.990
too cunning to be trusted.

38:12.010 --> 38:14.170
He's young after all.

38:14.660 --> 38:16.490
So many young men

38:16.490 --> 38:18.640
in Shangjing Town fancy Duoduo.

38:18.660 --> 38:22.190
Fan Xian is no different.

38:22.210 --> 38:23.560
Your Majesty, by thinking so,

38:23.580 --> 38:25.880
I'm afraid you're tricked by Fan Xian already.

38:25.900 --> 38:28.470
Is Her Majesty less wise

38:28.490 --> 38:31.450
than you are?

38:31.450 --> 38:33.560
I don't mean that.

38:35.250 --> 38:36.880
Though Shen Zhong remains safe today,

38:36.900 --> 38:38.490
the seeds have been sowed.

38:38.490 --> 38:39.670
What seed?

38:39.690 --> 38:41.400
Seeds of suspicion and fear.

38:41.420 --> 38:42.800
By killing Xiao En,

38:42.820 --> 38:45.210
Shen Zhong defied the Empress Dowager's order.

38:45.250 --> 38:46.750
He didn't report

38:46.770 --> 38:48.450
the smuggling, either.

38:49.380 --> 38:51.170
The Empress Dowager didn't blame him.

38:51.290 --> 38:52.840
But she'll remember it in heart.

38:53.770 --> 38:55.920
After all, the Empress Dowager trusts him.

38:55.940 --> 38:57.750
So if it happened before,

38:57.770 --> 38:59.560
she wouldn't blame him at all.

38:59.580 --> 39:00.580
Even if she felt dissatisfied,

39:00.580 --> 39:02.170
she would just let it go.

39:02.580 --> 39:04.410
But now it's different.

39:05.730 --> 39:07.410
What is different?

39:07.860 --> 39:09.670
Now the Empress Dowager

39:09.690 --> 39:11.600
has Shangshan Hu by her side.

39:14.620 --> 39:17.710
Commander Shen, I'm delighted

39:17.730 --> 39:19.470
that you're concerned about our country.

39:19.490 --> 39:21.400
How can I blame you?

39:21.420 --> 39:23.040
Your Majesty, you're really bright and perceptive.

39:23.730 --> 39:26.320
The smuggling can

39:26.660 --> 39:28.510
really be profitable.

39:28.530 --> 39:29.800
In this case,

39:29.820 --> 39:32.240
if we tell the truth,

39:32.580 --> 39:36.000
Fan Xian will surely be punished by Nanqing.

39:36.660 --> 39:38.490
His life is somewhat

39:38.730 --> 39:41.760
controlled by us.

39:43.140 --> 39:44.990
Your Majesty, please think twice.

39:45.010 --> 39:45.770
We can't follow

39:45.770 --> 39:47.710
our enemy's will.

39:47.730 --> 39:49.140
No matter how much money,

39:49.140 --> 39:50.840
we shouldn't be tempted.

40:08.010 --> 40:09.690
Perhaps,

40:10.250 --> 40:12.710
we can take the offer first, and see what happens later.

40:12.730 --> 40:14.240
Forgive me for being outspoken.

40:14.290 --> 40:16.560
We'd better be cautious.

40:18.820 --> 40:21.270
Then I'll think it over.

40:21.290 --> 40:23.130
Exactly.

40:24.530 --> 40:27.080
Let's put it aside for the moment.

40:27.140 --> 40:28.890
You may all leave.

40:29.250 --> 40:30.600
I'm leaving.

40:33.490 --> 40:35.840
Your Majesty, I bid you farewell.

40:42.180 --> 40:44.520
As a first rank military official,

40:45.010 --> 40:47.370
you don't have to kowtow to me.

40:47.770 --> 40:48.730
Proprieties must be observed.

40:48.730 --> 40:49.880
I'm loyal

40:49.900 --> 40:53.000
in heart and in behavior.

40:53.250 --> 40:55.280
Well said.

40:57.860 --> 41:01.000
In heart and in behavior,

41:02.660 --> 41:06.930
it's so well said.

41:21.900 --> 41:23.400
Though Shen Zhong is important

41:23.420 --> 41:24.470
for controlling the Embroidered Uniform Guards,

41:24.490 --> 41:25.970
Shangshan Hu is more powerful

41:25.970 --> 41:27.080
in the army.

41:27.100 --> 41:29.470
The more cautious and low-pitched Shangshan Hu is,

41:29.490 --> 41:32.800
the more arrogant and bossy Shen Zhong appears.

41:33.620 --> 41:36.690
Your trick is too simple.

41:37.660 --> 41:38.950
I'm afraid the Empress Dowager can see through it.

41:38.970 --> 41:40.010
Of course she understands

41:40.010 --> 41:41.100
Shangshan Hu takes the chance

41:41.100 --> 41:42.650
to attack Shen Zhong.

41:43.250 --> 41:44.890
But it's an overt scheme.

41:44.970 --> 41:45.770
Even if the Empress Dowager

41:45.770 --> 41:47.190
understands it all,

41:47.210 --> 41:49.690
she'll grow dissatisfied gradually.

41:49.770 --> 41:53.080
People change. It's human nature.

41:54.420 --> 41:55.180
Then it will be a situation of

41:55.180 --> 41:56.710
check and balance at most.

41:56.730 --> 41:58.510
The Empress Dowager won't kill Shen Zhong.

41:58.530 --> 42:01.410
Someone will if she doesn't.

42:01.450 --> 42:02.930
Do you have another plan?

42:03.290 --> 42:05.210
Tell His Majesty that

42:05.250 --> 42:07.280
I promised to kill Shen Zhong for him,

42:07.620 --> 42:09.040
and I'll definitely make it happen.

42:19.620 --> 42:21.280
That's what he said.

42:22.050 --> 42:24.840
Exceptionally tactful and resourceful,

42:24.860 --> 42:26.730
and good at writing books as well,

42:26.820 --> 42:28.600
what an excellent man!

42:33.180 --> 42:35.560
Did he copy the name list himself?

42:35.730 --> 42:36.810
Yes.

42:38.050 --> 42:40.240
His handwriting is poor.

42:40.660 --> 42:42.760
Auntie, what else do you tell him?

42:43.450 --> 42:44.800
Nothing else.

42:44.820 --> 42:46.010
I just warned him

42:46.010 --> 42:47.520
when he left.

42:47.660 --> 42:48.930
About what?

43:12.160 --> 43:15.740
In the river of history,

43:15.760 --> 43:19.230
time goes round and round.

43:22.040 --> 43:25.380
Memories about the former and present lives

43:25.400 --> 43:29.470
join each other in an endless way.

43:31.360 --> 43:33.980
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:34.000 --> 43:36.240
one season follows another in a flash,

43:36.240 --> 43:38.740
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:38.760 --> 43:40.360
I just can't give up

43:40.360 --> 43:43.700
to be with you for my whole life.

43:43.720 --> 43:49.190
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:50.440 --> 43:52.990
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:53.280 --> 43:55.320
Year after year in the wandering,

43:55.320 --> 43:57.980
I count the remaining years.

43:58.000 --> 44:00.180
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:00.200 --> 44:02.190
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:02.480 --> 44:04.870
I never feel regretful.

44:04.920 --> 44:06.280
In such a chaotic world,

44:06.280 --> 44:09.260
I still miss you as ever.

44:09.280 --> 44:12.230
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:12.520 --> 44:14.580
With a gentle heart,

44:14.600 --> 44:17.260
I cherish our remaining years.

44:17.280 --> 44:18.800
Even though we have to go through

44:18.800 --> 44:21.310
all the hardships along the journey,

44:21.440 --> 44:28.630
you always stay by my side,

44:28.720 --> 44:31.390
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:31.680 --> 44:33.760
Year after year in the wandering,

44:33.760 --> 44:36.420
I count the remaining years.

44:36.440 --> 44:38.580
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:38.600 --> 44:40.830
even though we end up the destiny,

44:41.040 --> 44:43.220
I never feel regretful.

44:43.240 --> 44:44.640
In such a chaotic world,

44:44.640 --> 44:47.700
I still miss you as ever.

44:47.720 --> 44:50.830
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:50.920 --> 44:53.060
With a gentle heart,

44:53.080 --> 44:55.780
I cherish our remaining years.

44:55.800 --> 44:57.240
Even though we have to go through

44:57.240 --> 44:59.900
all the hardships along the journey,

44:59.920 --> 45:08.680
you always stay by my side...
